# A2.1 multuid image: default-deny build context.
# The image only builds and tests the Rust workspace in native/; everything
# else (notably tmp/ test fixtures, data/, .git, node_modules) must never
# enter the image. Later lines take precedence over earlier ones.
**
!native/
!native/**
# Build output and host-local artifacts inside native/ stay out as well.
native/target/
